From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 14:23:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 27/49] dt-bindings: serial: ingenic: Allow RS-485 properties

The UARTs of Ingenic SoCs can drive a half-duplex RS-485 transceiver,
its driver enable on a GPIO given as rts-gpios. Reference rs485.yaml so
that the RS-485 properties can be used.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml
index ef9161a88..45c482b9c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@ maintainers:
 
 allOf:
   - $ref: serial.yaml#
+  - $ref: rs485.yaml#
 
 properties:
   $nodename:
